    "alert_id": "EX3_003",
    "title": "TDF renal monitoring overdue by >12 months",
    "message": "Guidelines require serum creatinine and eGFR every 12 months for experienced patients on TDF. The last creatinine was 72 umol/L on 2025-08-12, 196 days before today's visit — over 6 months ago. No renal function test has been ordered today, and the clinician's plan does not include creatinine or eGFR monitoring. This is a guideline-mandated annual monitoring gap.",
    "issue_type": "monitoring_gap",
